<title>ESTONIA: EMV MARKET MAKERS ANNOUNCED.</title>
<headline>EMV MARKET MAKERS ANNOUNCED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn stock exchange said on Wednesday the market makers for EMV shares are Forekspank, Tallinna Pank, Innovatsioonipank and Hansapank.</p>
<p>The minimum quantity is 500 and price step 0.05 kroons, the bourse added in a statement.</p>
<p>EMV shares are traded on the main list of the bourse from today.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
